Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.14,0:00:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enya, there's something\NI'd like to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.74,0:00:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does it mean to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's to obtain all that one desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.40,0:00:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you were to distill life into its\Nessence, that is what it would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lust for riches, a desire for\Nfame, food, love, and lovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.44,0:00:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is life's goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.30,0:00:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But one must always fight\Nto get what one wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that correct, Enya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.88,0:00:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.38,0:00:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if the battle is lost and one\Nfails to obtain what one desires most,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.16,0:00:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the result is frustration,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.06,0:00:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pain, and a sense of failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One carries the wound into the\Nfuture, into the next fearful battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.72,0:01:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe conquering that fear once\Nand for all is what it means to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.60,0:01:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one who stands at the pinnacle\Nis the one who has no fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.40,0:01:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand, Enya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.90,0:01:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was the one who told you about the\Nexistence of your stand and how to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.92,0:01:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, you have an immortal body.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.54,0:01:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there anything you could possibly fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.90,0:01:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps, old woman. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.78,0:01:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What burdens you, my lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.10,0:01:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Joestar bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.42,0:01:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Joestar?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.68,0:01:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They worry you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those worms are mere trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.02,0:01:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your enemies are no match\Nfor your stand. Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.58,0:01:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I must believe it's\Ndestiny when the lives of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.78,0:01:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those worms are so thoroughly\Nentangled with mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.46,0:01:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a fate that has been written\Nfor us all from the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.50,0:01:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me be clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.42,0:01:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is not the Joestars that I fear,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.10,0:01:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the fact that I can never\Nunderestimate their bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.64,0:01:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to obliterate all fear,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have decided that I must remove\Nthe Joestars from the cogs of fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to go and eliminate\Nthem yourself simply
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.06,0:02:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because you feel that they\Ncannot be underestimated?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.66,0:02:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.90,0:02:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Foolishness!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.81,0:02:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should never engage\Nin such trivial matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.20,0:02:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are beneath someone of your stature.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.02,0:02:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have sent seven stand-users\Nto command. The Empress,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.62,0:02:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Wheel of Fortune, the Hangman, and\NTemperance, the Emperor, and the Devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.24,0:02:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of them on the move and ready\Nto strike whenever you call.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.68,0:02:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to these allies, you need not\Ntake any action yourself, Lord Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.48,0:03:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.18,0:03:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.58,0:03:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.98,0:03:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.88,0:03:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.48,0:04:20.65,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,475)\pos(192,810)}Episode 7: Strength
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.64,0:04:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A freighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.84,0:04:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't see it at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.28,0:04:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, something's\Nbothering you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.72,0:04:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you worried there might be\Nanother stand user on this freighter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.74,0:04:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not ideal, but we could handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.52,0:04:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.43,0:04:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strange they lowered the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.00,0:04:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's not a single soul\Nto be seen around here anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.86,0:04:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ship came all this way to rescue us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.38,0:04:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There has to be some\Nsort of crew on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.14,0:04:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if they're all stand\Nusers, I'm getting on this boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.00,0:04:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm done drifting in circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.58,0:05:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take my hand, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.06,0:05:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help you get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.84,0:05:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.26,0:05:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's with this ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.56,0:05:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no captain in the control room?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.68,0:05:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no engineer in the radio room?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.70,0:05:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no one anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.16,0:05:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.68,0:05:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the gauges and machinery are\Nworking properly, just like normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.26,0:05:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're just all in the\Nbathroom with a bad case of the rugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.80,0:05:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.71,0:05:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't anyone around?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.86,0:06:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to see this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.14,0:06:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come here, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.05,0:06:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.20,0:06:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An ape!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.40,0:06:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's an ape inside that cage!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.72,0:06:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an orangutan. Who\Ncares about a friggin' ape?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.60,0:06:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's split up and find whoever's\Nbeen feeding this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.24,0:06:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it doesn't appear\Nto be broken, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.74,0:06:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.65,0:06:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Avdol!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.57,0:06:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.52,0:06:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.90,0:07:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That isn't any way to greet a lady\Nyou've never met before now, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.02,0:07:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no one was touching the controls!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.82,0:07:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw that crane move, even though\Nthere was no one operating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.30,0:07:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe in\Nghosts, but what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.68,0:07:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.08,0:07:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crane impaled him all on its own!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.22,0:07:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your guard up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.48,0:07:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's someone hostile here. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.14,0:07:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't touch the machinery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.46,0:07:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.37,0:07:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it moves or runs on electricity!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.28,0:07:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't lay a finger on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.76,0:07:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to live, then\Nyou'll do exactly as I tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.92,0:07:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.83,0:07:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get into the cabin below and stay\Nthere until I tell you otherwise!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.52,0:07:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did any one of you see even a\Nglimpse of a stand just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.70,0:07:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.84,0:07:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.82,0:07:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was the closest to the\Ncrane and yet I felt nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.78,0:07:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have been able to send something!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.54,0:07:51.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.45,0:07:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll send Hierophant Green to\Ntake a look around the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.58,0:08:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.84,0:08:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But scary things keep happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.60,0:08:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever you guys are around!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.58,0:08:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you guys be jinxed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.90,0:08:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard about people who cause\Ndisasters that endanger everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.10,0:08:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if that's what you\Nare, I'd better stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.36,0:08:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have just one bit of truth\Nfor you, so listen closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.98,0:08:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens, we're on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.90,0:08:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.98,0:08:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you stay with\Nthe others, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.90,0:08:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.10,0:09:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to open the cage for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.54,0:09:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.82,0:09:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea where the key is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.78,0:09:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're too big to let out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.16,0:09:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're giving me an apple?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.94,0:09:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.80,0:09:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This apple's been cut with a knife, and\Nthe color hasn't really changed yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.76,0:09:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks totally fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.26,0:09:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like it was cut a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.36,0:09:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I guess there really must be\Nsomeone hiding somewhere on this boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.24,0:09:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is the person who feeds you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.18,0:09:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has he gone off and left you here?
