Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.10,0:09:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.96,0:09:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you're a pretty smart monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.14,0:09:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who trained you to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.84,0:10:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.88,0:10:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A monkey like you is\Nactually into looking at...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.44,0:10:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pin-ups of girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.94,0:10:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid! Be careful—there,\Nthey say an orangutan
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.02,0:10:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has five times the\Nstrength of a normal human?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.34,0:10:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it could easily rip\Noff your arm come on
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.78,0:10:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stay with us in the\Nroom on the other side!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.98,0:10:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go off by yourself. Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.44,0:10:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's inconceivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.92,0:10:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had Hierophant Green\Nsearch every inch of this ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.80,0:10:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I can't find a single\Nsign of human life aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.14,0:10:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've searched every pipe and crevice,\Nbut still came up empty-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.74,0:10:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.68,0:10:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.88,0:11:00.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't get a connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.52,0:11:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, try again, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.06,0:11:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.97,0:11:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel sticky from the salt water.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.82,0:11:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.22,0:11:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.86,0:12:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.58,0:12:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
