Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.88,0:13:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.82,0:13:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell ripped out that fan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.66,0:13:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Had to be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.02,0:13:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this ape's a stand user,\Nbut where's the stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.94,0:13:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should be able to see the\Ndamn thing, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.40,0:13:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.96,0:13:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The steel propeller bent\Non its own like it's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.46,0:13:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.37,0:13:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.60,0:13:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.98,0:13:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no stand in sight\Nand somehow the window broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.74,0:13:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.22,0:14:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.80,0:14:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ape just sank into\Nthe wall and disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.26,0:14:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you saw that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.58,0:14:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay close to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.88,0:14:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something bad is going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.36,0:14:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ape vanished into the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.10,0:14:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that orangutan has\Nto be the Stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.60,0:14:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I touched it earlier, I felt\Na Stand's energy coming from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.22,0:14:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no doubt that he's\Nthe one we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.92,0:14:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't make any sense. Why can't\NI see this Stand like I always do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.12,0:14:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait what If I'm seeing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.10,0:14:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it already what's going
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.86,0:14:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on this isn't good it's\Nfollowing us is the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.96,0:14:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freighter trying to is\Nit possible the ship
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.12,0:15:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,itself is so the stand is\Nactually the freighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.90,0:15:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, you son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.18,0:15:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.46,0:15:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ship itself and everything\Non it is a gigantic stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.36,0:15:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The entire ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.80,0:15:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there are stands that non-stand users\Nlike that girl on the crew members can see?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.32,0:15:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only possible explanation for that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.42,0:15:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That its immense energy\Nis making it possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.36,0:15:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to be seen with the naked eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.98,0:15:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But all this must demand a tremendous\Namount of energy to operate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.10,0:15:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stand as huge as this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.44,0:15:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kick, send Hierophant green to Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.36,0:15:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can help get us out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.02,0:15:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.94,0:15:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's got a firm hold on\Nmy stand and I'm stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.86,0:15:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what it means to face death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.76,0:15:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We fell for this trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.12,0:15:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now we're hopelessly\Nensnared with no way to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.84,0:15:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pressure keeps increasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.40,0:15:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, our bodies\Nare going to be pulverized.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.54,0:15:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.02,0:15:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, we were careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.00,0:16:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.00,0:16:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The word that the orangutan\Nwas pointing to was strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.36,0:16:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means force, energy, power, or aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.92,0:16:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it is the eighth\Ncard of the tarot deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.74,0:16:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It suggests challenge, a\Nstrong will, and hidden powers.
