Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.86,0:16:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn ape, he thinks he's won already, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.40,0:16:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This entire ship is my\Nstand, and you've lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.12,0:16:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're totally outmatched and helpless,\Nand there's nothing you can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.02,0:16:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro needed no explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.42,0:17:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knew exactly what the ape was saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.82,0:17:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here, monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.00,0:17:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That button's not part of your stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.84,0:17:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.90,0:17:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it wounded your pride, since\Nyou thought you'd already beaten us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.80,0:17:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's not hurt at all, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.96,0:17:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because apes like you\Ndon't have any pride.
