Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.14,0:17:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what makes\Nyou an ape and not a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.86,0:17:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going to hurt now, is your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.86,0:18:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.84,0:18:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard that, when frightened,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.74,0:18:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,animals show their stomachs to\Nsignal their submission to the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.70,0:18:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're asking me to forgive you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.26,0:18:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid your actions have already\Ngone beyond the rules of the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.04,0:18:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I don't think so.
