Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.04,0:18:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.04,0:18:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pipes and walls are distorting!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.46,0:18:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole ship is twisting up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.30,0:18:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, be surprised about it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.88,0:18:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ship is about to sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.04,0:18:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.60,0:19:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back to the lifeboats!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.68,0:19:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.46,0:19:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ship's shape is changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.28,0:19:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's turning into a shabby little boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.34,0:19:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't seen it myself,\NI wouldn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.16,0:19:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That ape was traveling\Nthe sea on his own stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.46,0:19:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What terrifying power!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.18,0:19:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the first time I've\Nencountered such energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.14,0:19:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hate to say it, but we were\Ncompletely overwhelmed this round.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.14,0:19:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Jotaro hadn't figured it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.22,0:19:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we would have been done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.52,0:19:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we going to encounter even more stands\Nwith crazy unknown powers from now on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.42,0:19:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to be ready for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.78,0:19:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you want some gum?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.08,0:19:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we're going to be\Ndrifting again. Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.54,0:19:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My cigarettes are soaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.86,0:19:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There'll be plenty of sun and\Ntime for them to get dry, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.20,0:19:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to pray that we get\Nrescued and reach Singapore safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.34,0:19:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.92,0:19:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been four days since we left Japan.
