Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.68,0:20:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lord, it would appear that\Nstrength has been defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.82,0:20:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But have no fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.74,0:20:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The remaining six stand users are all very\Npowerful and each deadlier than the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.08,0:20:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And one of them is my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.84,0:20:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His right arm shall crush our enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.84,0:20:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Joestars will not pose a threat\Nwhen he's finished with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.82,0:20:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are a strange old woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.18,0:20:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it that you desire the most?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.72,0:20:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, but I've told you many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.80,0:20:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only wish is to stay\Nby your side, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.28,0:20:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your guardian spirit\Nhas unbelievable power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.50,0:20:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your ability to escape trouble and your\Nstrange life are the result of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.70,0:20:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like to see your life unfold.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.80,0:21:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only thing I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.14,0:21:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once upon a time,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.74,0:21:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there was a prince from the land of Sumatra\Nwho traveled the seas seeking new lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.54,0:21:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eventually,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.45,0:21:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he happened upon an island\Ninhabited by lions called Sinks,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.88,0:21:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an island he named Singapore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.18,0:21:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today, it's straits bustle with ships\Nand tankers from around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.12,0:21:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This nation that shares both Western and\NEastern heritage, thanks to free trade,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.60,0:21:27.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is Tropical Singapore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.28,0:21:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief, we finally\Nmade it to dry land.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.02,0:21:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll clean up and get\Nsome rest at a hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.32,0:21:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we've recharged, we'll\Nfigure out our route to Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.46,0:21:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's stay at that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.24,0:22:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.68,0:22:15.06,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.98,0:22:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don't you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.06,0:22:17.35,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don'tcha know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.02,0:22:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you move too quick, go away.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.35,0:22:18.81,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.26,0:22:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.60,0:22:22.07,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.64,0:22:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the buzzer men by the Nile.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.07,0:22:24.40,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the bazaar men by the Nile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.34,0:22:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got the money on a bed.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.40,0:22:26.74,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They got the money on a bet
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.40,0:22:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Called crocodiles.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.74,0:22:28.24,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Gold crocodiles
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.00,0:22:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I snapped their teeth on your cigarette.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.91,0:22:31.37,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.96,0:22:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Falling tied to the hookah. I say.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.37,0:22:33.58,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Foreign types with their hookah pipes say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.26,0:22:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.26,0:22:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.58,0:22:43.13,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.40,0:22:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.00,0:22:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.51,0:22:56.98,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.98,0:22:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spin around and they cross the floor.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.98,0:22:59.35,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They spin around and they cross the floor
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.96,0:23:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.35,0:23:00.60,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.50,0:23:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink then\Nthey bring you more.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.65,0:23:03.98,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink then they bring you more
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.64,0:23:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the school kids so sick of books.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.98,0:23:06.32,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the school kids so sick of books
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.28,0:23:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're like the punk and the metal band.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.32,0:23:08.65,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They like the punk and the metal band
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.34,0:23:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.65,0:23:10.11,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.58,0:23:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're walking like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.95,0:23:13.28,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're walking like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.58,0:23:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the kids in the marketplace say?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.28,0:23:15.49,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the kids in the marketplace say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.32,0:23:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian.
